00:56:28.690 --> 00:56:35.810
Lee H. Hamilton, Senator Charles Mathias Jr.,
Representative Richard Cheney, Lieutenant

00:56:35.810 --> 00:56:40.740
General Brent Scowcroft and also our thanks
